    "action": "confirm",
    "canonical": "Separate commands from queries: place as much logic as possible in side-effect-free functions — refactoring a method that both calculates and modifies into a side-effect-free calculation plus a simple command that returns no domain data — eliminate side effects by deriving a new immutable value object instead of mutating state, avoid modifying arguments, and centralize complex calculation in immutable value objects with closed side-effect-free operations."
  },
